  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Ministry of Transport of the Palestinian Territories has applied for an ORIO grant to reform its public bus service.To implement such a project, an assessment of the current bus transport policy needs to be executed.This project will provide Technical Assistance (TA) to an Input and Output Plan for the public bus transport services project under the Facility for Infrastructure Development (ORIO).</narrative>
